refused: d128_range_labels_out_of_order.cy:5:28, line 5 column 28
 5 |     for $i in range[to: 5, from: 1]:
   |                            ^^^^
 what: `from:` is out of order here
 why:  `from:` is required, `to:` or `before:` says where it ends, and `step_by:` comes after them, in that order (D128)
